  "findings": [
    "Online initialization creates each HQ from startingMatchData.location_card_left/right, converts that starting-data record faction name via FactionStringToEnum, then writes SetMainFactionBySide(side,converted byte).",
    "GameState getter reads saved LeftMainFaction/RightMainFaction, setter only writes side1/2, ClearGameStateVariables resets both to0.",
    "Current CDO fields are bytes at0x66b/0x66c, both0; CDO observations are defaults, not live match values.",
    "Current managed getter derives faction from current HQ.Definition; importer currently ignores SnapshotCard.Faction. The native source is starting data, so an independent saved-field model and explicit import/setup are needed."
  ],
