  "implementation_plan": [
    "Add independent saved main-faction bytes with explicit setter/reset/getter; preserve direct GameState out-alias contract separately from fresh CardFunctions wrapper.",
    "Initialize from explicit starting-data faction metadata, not current mutable HQ definition. Audit synthetic self-play setup defaults separately.",
